#: appletbrowser.cpp:363
msgid ""
"<qt>When clicking <b>Close</b>, this dialog will be closed with no further "
"action taken.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se preme en <b>Pechar</b>, este diálogo será pechado sen realizar "
"nengunha outra acción.</qt>"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:364
msgid "Add selected widgets"
msgstr "Engadir os widgets escollidos"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:365
msgid ""
"<qt>When clicking <b>Add Widget</b>, the selected widgets will be added to "
"your desktop.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se preme en <b>Engadir o widget</b>, os widgets escollidos serán "
"engadidos ao seu escritorio.</qt>"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:366
msgid "Install new widgets"
msgstr "Instalar novos widgets"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:367
msgid ""
"<qt>Selecting <b>Get New Widgets</b> will show a window that allows you to "
"download new widgets directly from the Internet, while Install From File "
"allows you to add new widgets from files you have on disk.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se escolle <b>Obter novos widgets</b> mostrarase unha fiestra que lle "
"permite obter novos widgets directamente de internet, mentres que con "
"Instalar dun ficheiro permítelle engadilos de ficheiros que teña no disco "
"duro.</qt>"

